      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "We received complaints and feedback when voices were at 15db gain. So, we added an additional 6db gain to the voice in build 803. That means regular audio at 10db default gain is already significantly lower than voice.\n\nChanging the default to 0 would cause default audio to be far lower than voice (and way too quiet overall).\n\nWe won't be changing this for now.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5d1c2081580122539dabf6e1",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5b17092ff3e2bd448d9dee5b",
        "alias": "Fern green Mongoose",
        "aliasID": "65c29c23ed6eefce4c7ed097",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/d7107d87532506cb8f3b688effefb3c6.jpg",
        "created": "2018-06-05T22:05:35.242Z",
